{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o028c","title":"治许昌宫起景福承光殿","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o028c-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"治许昌宫起景福承光殿","evidence":["mingdi-e-o028c-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":232,"label":"九月纪事所附","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y232","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o026","basis":"九月纪事所附"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o028c-q","mingdi-q-o026","mingdi-q-b-412fc25655f53a4b4d33"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o028c-q","source_order":[3,189,"O028c"],"order":809}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o028c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-e391299b61967ac23843","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，以卫尉董昭为司徒〖12〗。九月，行幸摩陂〖13〗。治许昌宫，起景福、承光殿。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-412fc25655f53a4b4d33","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-412fc25655f53a4b4d33","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：太和六年（公元 232）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-d1427f90b1f8dd585e5a","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"mingdi-q-o026","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-42d0ed5edde34d9ea9f5","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月〖1〗，诏曰：“古之帝王，封建诸侯，所以藩屏王室也〖2〗。《诗》不云乎，‘怀德维宁，宗子维城’〖3〗。秦、汉继周，或强或弱〖4〗，俱失厥中〖5〗。大魏创业，诸王开国；随时之宜，未有定制：非所以永为后法也。其改封诸侯王，皆以郡为国〖6〗。”三月，癸酉〖7〗，行东巡；所过存问高年鳏寡孤独〖8〗，赐谷帛。乙亥〖9〗，月犯轩辕大星。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":168}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
